        <!-- Photo frames: each frame is an empty masked container. Click to add
             an empty frame to the canvas, then drag a photo onto it (or select
             the frame and click a photo) to fill it. Once filled, drag inside
             the frame to pan the photo and scroll-wheel to zoom (viewpoint). -->
        <div class="ed-section-title">Frames</div>
        <p class="ed-section-hint">Add an empty frame, then drag a photo into it.</p>
